{"capturado_en": "2026-11-17T18:33:17+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Arcante: Definitive Edition", "steam_appid": 1815310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815310/extras/6b51a4bc676ecad3b14c25883ce4e486.avif?t=1791627115\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Warning:</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>[Oct. 2026]</i></strong><i> This game is now <strong>very</strong> outdated. If you like the concept and want to see what I'm currently building, please visit my Developer Page to check out my latest project!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by games that defined the genre, Arcante will bring you to a land where exploring and listening to suggestions is crucial to succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover game mechanics as you play and fight enemies with a dynamic combat system, that lets you play the game First Person, while your party members attack in turns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't feel like going too fast? The game can be played <strong>Turn-Based</strong>! Take your time to consider your next move and to choose the ability that will let you win the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the party, train them, teach them useful skills, loot or buy equipment and find out what works best for them. Will your team be able to rise up to the increasingly difficult challenges, and become the heroes whose deeds are praised for the eternity?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysteries and hidden treasures are waiting for you, as well as both dungeons and dragons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characteristics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-Based (Press Enter any time to play turn-based)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Classes, 20 abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Animated Portraits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Color-Coded Equipment with Thousands of Combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Armor Types, 15 Weapon Types</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Old-Style Challenges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing the game once will unlock a new game mode: you will be able to start a new game with any number of characters in your party, from one to four. Are you up for a challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Definitive Edition</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The game was greatly changed in response of users feedbacks, this version includes all the changes and more! </strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Better Graphics, more Intuitive, new Maps and Quests.</strong></p></li><li><strong><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exciting fighting mechanics: dodge, block, interrupt, and shield yourself to master the fights!</p></strong></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815310/extras/6b51a4bc676ecad3b14c25883ce4e486.avif?t=1791627115\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Warning:</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>[Oct. 2026]</i></strong><i> This game is now <strong>very</strong> outdated. If you like the concept and want to see what I'm currently building, please visit my Developer Page to check out my latest project!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by games that defined the genre, Arcante will bring you to a land where exploring and listening to suggestions is crucial to succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover game mechanics as you play and fight enemies with a dynamic combat system, that lets you play the game First Person, while your party members attack in turns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't feel like going too fast? The game can be played <strong>Turn-Based</strong>! Take your time to consider your next move and to choose the ability that will let you win the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the party, train them, teach them useful skills, loot or buy equipment and find out what works best for them. Will your team be able to rise up to the increasingly difficult challenges, and become the heroes whose deeds are praised for the eternity?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysteries and hidden treasures are waiting for you, as well as both dungeons and dragons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characteristics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-Based (Press Enter any time to play turn-based)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Classes, 20 abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Animated Portraits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Color-Coded Equipment with Thousands of Combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Armor Types, 15 Weapon Types</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Old-Style Challenges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing the game once will unlock a new game mode: you will be able to start a new game with any number of characters in your party, from one to four. Are you up for a challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Definitive Edition</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The game was greatly changed in response of users feedbacks, this version includes all the changes and more! </strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Better Graphics, more Intuitive, new Maps and Quests.</strong></p></li><li><strong><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exciting fighting mechanics: dodge, block, interrupt, and shield yourself to master the fights!</p></strong></li></ul>", "short_description": "A Fantasy Action RPG. Create your party and head off on an adventure. Playing Turn-Based or Real Time is up to you.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815310/header.jpg?t=1791627115", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815310/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1791627115", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815310/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1791627115", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i3-3225 3.3 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce MX150<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i5-7300U 3.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Radeon RX 580, Nvidia GeForce GTX 1660<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimu